{"page":464,"verses":[{"verse_key":"39:48","surah":39,"ayah":48,"ar_uthmani":"وَبَدَا لَهُمْ سَيِّـَٔاتُ مَا كَسَبُوا۟ وَحَاقَ بِهِم مَّا كَانُوا۟ بِهِۦ يَسْتَهْزِءُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"the evil of their deeds will become plain to them, and they will be overwhelmed by that at which they used to laugh.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَبَدَا","en_gloss":"And will become apparent","transliteration":"wabadā","verse_key":"39:48"},{"pos":2,"ar":"لَهُمْ","en_gloss":"to them","transliteration":"lahum","verse_key":"39:48"},{"pos":3,"ar":"سَيِّـَٔاتُ","en_gloss":"(the) evils","transliteration":"sayyiātu","verse_key":"39:48"},{"pos":4,"ar":"مَا","en_gloss":"(of) what","transliteration":"mā","verse_key":"39:48"},{"pos":5,"ar":"كَسَبُوا۟","en_gloss":"they earned","transliteration":"kasabū","verse_key":"39:48"},{"pos":6,"ar":"وَحَاقَ","en_gloss":"and will surround","transliteration":"waḥāqa","verse_key":"39:48"},{"pos":7,"ar":"بِهِم","en_gloss":"them","transliteration":"bihim","verse_key":"39:48"},{"pos":8,"ar":"مَّا","en_gloss":"what","transliteration":"mā","verse_key":"39:48"},{"pos":9,"ar":"كَانُوا۟","en_gloss":"they used to","transliteration":"kānū","verse_key":"39:48"},{"pos":10,"ar":"بِهِۦ","en_gloss":"[in it]","transliteration":"bihi","verse_key":"39:48"},{"pos":11,"ar":"يَسْتَهْزِءُونَ","en_gloss":"mock","transliteration":"yastahziūna","verse_key":"39:48"},{"pos":12,"ar":"٤٨","en_gloss":"(48)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"39:48"}]},{"verse_key":"39:49","surah":39,"ayah":49,"ar_uthmani":"فَإِذَا مَسَّ ٱلْإِنسَـٰنَ ضُرٌّ دَعَانَا ثُمَّ إِذَا خَوَّلْنَـٰهُ نِعْمَةً مِّنَّا قَالَ إِنَّمَآ أُوتِيتُهُۥ عَلَىٰ عِلْمٍۭ ۚ بَلْ هِىَ فِتْنَةٌ وَلَـٰكِنَّ أَكْثَرَهُمْ لَا يَعْلَمُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"When man suffers some affliction, he cries out to Us, but when We favour him with Our blessing, he says, ‘All this has been given to me because of my knowledge’- it is only a test, though most of them do not know it.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"فَإِذَا","en_gloss":"So when","transliteration":"fa-idhā","verse_key":"39:49"},{"pos":2,"ar":"مَسَّ","en_gloss":"touches","transliteration":"massa","verse_key":"39:49"},{"pos":3,"ar":"ٱلْإِنسَـٰنَ","en_gloss":"[the] man","transliteration":"l-insāna","verse_key":"39:49"},{"pos":4,"ar":"ضُرٌّۭ","en_gloss":"adversity","transliteration":"ḍurrun","verse_key":"39:49"},{"pos":5,"ar":"دَعَانَا","en_gloss":"he calls upon Us","transliteration":"daʿānā","verse_key":"39:49"},{"pos":6,"ar":"ثُمَّ","en_gloss":"then","transliteration":"thumma","verse_key":"39:49"},{"pos":7,"ar":"إِذَا","en_gloss":"when","transliteration":"idhā","verse_key":"39:49"},{"pos":8,"ar":"خَوَّلْنَـٰهُ","en_gloss":"We bestow (on) him","transliteration":"khawwalnāhu","verse_key":"39:49"},{"pos":9,"ar":"نِعْمَةًۭ","en_gloss":"a favor","transliteration":"niʿ'matan","verse_key":"39:49"},{"pos":10,"ar":"مِّنَّا","en_gloss":"from Us","transliteration":"minnā","verse_key":"39:49"},{"pos":11,"ar":"قَالَ","en_gloss":"he says","transliteration":"qāla","verse_key":"39:49"},{"pos":12,"ar":"إِنَّمَآ","en_gloss":"Only","transliteration":"innamā","verse_key":"39:49"},{"pos":13,"ar":"أُوتِيتُهُۥ","en_gloss":"I have been given it","transliteration":"ūtītuhu","verse_key":"39:49"},{"pos":14,"ar":"عَلَىٰ","en_gloss":"for","transliteration":"ʿalā","verse_key":"39:49"},{"pos":15,"ar":"عِلْمٍۭ ۚ","en_gloss":"knowledge","transliteration":"ʿil'min","verse_key":"39:49"},{"pos":16,"ar":"بَلْ","en_gloss":"Nay","transliteration":"bal","verse_key":"39:49"},{"pos":17,"ar":"هِىَ","en_gloss":"it","transliteration":"hiya","verse_key":"39:49"},{"pos":18,"ar":"فِتْنَةٌۭ","en_gloss":"(is) a trial","transliteration":"fit'natun","verse_key":"39:49"},{"pos":19,"ar":"وَلَـٰكِنَّ","en_gloss":"but","transliteration":"walākinna","verse_key":"39:49"},{"pos":20,"ar":"أَكْثَرَهُمْ","en_gloss":"most of them","transliteration":"aktharahum","verse_key":"39:49"},{"pos":21,"ar":"لَا","en_gloss":"(do) not","transliteration":"lā","verse_key":"39:49"},{"pos":22,"ar":"يَعْلَمُونَ","en_gloss":"know","transliteration":"yaʿlamūna","verse_key":"39:49"},{"pos":23,"ar":"٤٩","en_gloss":"(49)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"39:49"}]},{"verse_key":"39:50","surah":39,"ayah":50,"ar_uthmani":"قَدْ قَالَهَا ٱلَّذِينَ مِن قَبْلِهِمْ فَمَآ أَغْنَىٰ عَنْهُم مَّا كَانُوا۟ يَكْسِبُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Those who lived before them said the same. What they did was of no use to them;","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"قَدْ","en_gloss":"Indeed","transliteration":"qad","verse_key":"39:50"},{"pos":2,"ar":"قَالَهَا","en_gloss":"said it","transliteration":"qālahā","verse_key":"39:50"},{"pos":3,"ar":"ٱلَّذِينَ","en_gloss":"those","transliteration":"alladhīna","verse_key":"39:50"},{"pos":4,"ar":"مِن","en_gloss":"before them","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"39:50"},{"pos":5,"ar":"قَبْلِهِمْ","en_gloss":"before them","transliteration":"qablihim","verse_key":"39:50"},{"pos":6,"ar":"فَمَآ","en_gloss":"but (did) not","transliteration":"famā","verse_key":"39:50"},{"pos":7,"ar":"أَغْنَىٰ","en_gloss":"avail","transliteration":"aghnā","verse_key":"39:50"},{"pos":8,"ar":"عَنْهُم","en_gloss":"them","transliteration":"ʿanhum","verse_key":"39:50"},{"pos":9,"ar":"مَّا","en_gloss":"what","transliteration":"mā","verse_key":"39:50"},{"pos":10,"ar":"كَانُوا۟","en_gloss":"they used to","transliteration":"kānū","verse_key":"39:50"},{"pos":11,"ar":"يَكْسِبُونَ","en_gloss":"earn","transliteration":"yaksibūna","verse_key":"39:50"},{"pos":12,"ar":"٥٠","en_gloss":"(50)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"39:50"}]},{"verse_key":"39:51","surah":39,"ayah":51,"ar_uthmani":"فَأَصَابَهُمْ سَيِّـَٔاتُ مَا كَسَبُوا۟ ۚ وَٱلَّذِينَ ظَلَمُوا۟ مِنْ هَـٰٓؤُلَآءِ سَيُصِيبُهُمْ سَيِّـَٔاتُ مَا كَسَبُوا۟ وَمَا هُم بِمُعْجِزِينَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"they suffered its evil effects. Today’s wrongdoers will also suffer the evil effects of their deeds: they will not escape.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"فَأَصَابَهُمْ","en_gloss":"Then struck them","transliteration":"fa-aṣābahum","verse_key":"39:51"},{"pos":2,"ar":"سَيِّـَٔاتُ","en_gloss":"(the) evils","transliteration":"sayyiātu","verse_key":"39:51"},{"pos":3,"ar":"مَا","en_gloss":"(of) what","transliteration":"mā","verse_key":"39:51"},{"pos":4,"ar":"كَسَبُوا۟ ۚ","en_gloss":"they earned","transliteration":"kasabū","verse_key":"39:51"},{"pos":5,"ar":"وَٱلَّذِينَ","en_gloss":"And those who","transliteration":"wa-alladhīna","verse_key":"39:51"},{"pos":6,"ar":"ظَلَمُوا۟","en_gloss":"have wronged","transliteration":"ẓalamū","verse_key":"39:51"},{"pos":7,"ar":"مِنْ","en_gloss":"of","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"39:51"},{"pos":8,"ar":"هَـٰٓؤُلَآءِ","en_gloss":"these","transliteration":"hāulāi","verse_key":"39:51"},{"pos":9,"ar":"سَيُصِيبُهُمْ","en_gloss":"will strike them","transliteration":"sayuṣībuhum","verse_key":"39:51"},{"pos":10,"ar":"سَيِّـَٔاتُ","en_gloss":"(the) evils","transliteration":"sayyiātu","verse_key":"39:51"},{"pos":11,"ar":"مَا","en_gloss":"(of) what","transliteration":"mā","verse_key":"39:51"},{"pos":12,"ar":"كَسَبُوا۟","en_gloss":"they earned","transliteration":"kasabū","verse_key":"39:51"},{"pos":13,"ar":"وَمَا","en_gloss":"and not","transliteration":"wamā","verse_key":"39:51"},{"pos":14,"ar":"هُم","en_gloss":"they","transliteration":"hum","verse_key":"39:51"},{"pos":15,"ar":"بِمُعْجِزِينَ","en_gloss":"will be able to escape","transliteration":"bimuʿ'jizīna","verse_key":"39:51"},{"pos":16,"ar":"٥١","en_gloss":"(51)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"39:51"}]},{"verse_key":"39:52","surah":39,"ayah":52,"ar_uthmani":"أَوَلَمْ يَعْلَمُوٓا۟ أَنَّ ٱللَّهَ يَبْسُطُ ٱلرِّزْقَ لِمَن يَشَآءُ وَيَقْدِرُ ۚ إِنَّ فِى ذَٰلِكَ لَـَٔايَـٰتٍ لِّقَوْمٍ يُؤْمِنُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Do they not know that God provides abun-dantly for anyone He will and gives sparingly to anyone He will? There truly are signs in this for those who believe.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"أَوَلَمْ","en_gloss":"Do not","transliteration":"awalam","verse_key":"39:52"},{"pos":2,"ar":"يَعْلَمُوٓا۟","en_gloss":"they know","